"[Ultrasound screening for chromosomal anomalies by assessment of the fetal nasal bone during 11‐14 weeks of            
gestation‐‐a pilot study]. [Bulgarian]", "abstract": "AimTo assess the feasibility of ultrasound screening for          
chromosomal anomalies by verification of the fetal nasal bone at 11-14 weeks gestation.MethodsA prospective longitudinal
