anomalies in the first trimester of pregnancy.europepmc.org"}, {"study_index": 291, "title": "Second‐trimester prenatal 
screening for Down syndrome and the relationship of maternal serum biochemical markers to pregnancy complications with  
adverse outcome", "abstract": "In a group of 26 524 control pregnancies and a group of 3728 pregnancies affected by one 
