patients."}, {"study_index": 293, "title": "Analysis of maternal serum alpha‐fetoprotein and free ß human chorionic     
gonadotrophin in the first trimester: implications for Down's syndrome screening", "abstract": "The aim of this study   
was to determine the maternal population, pregnancy, serum alpha-fetoprotein (AFP) and free beta subunit of human       
chorionic gonadotrophin (F beta hCG) parameters in a large series of women attending prenatal clinics before 15 weeks'  
