screening results are associated with fetal structural and chromosomal abnormalities and/or adverse pregnancy outcomes. 
Close fetal and maternal surveillance are indicated when such pregnancies are identified."}, {"study_index": 296,       
"title": "Maternal serum S100 protein in normal and Down syndrome pregnancies", "abstract": "Protein S100 is a low      
