  - Second trimester serum marker studies: ~25                                                                          
  - Ultrasound/nuchal translucency studies: ~20                                                                         
  - Combined screening strategies: ~10                                                                                  
  - Other screening methods: ~8                                                                                         
                                                                                                                        
  **KEY FINDINGS FROM ABSTRACT ANALYSIS:**                                                                              
