  - Common markers evaluated: PAPP-A, free beta-hCG, AFP, inhibin A, ADAM 12, nuchal translucency                       
  - Detection rates typically ranged 60-90% at 5% false positive rate                                                   
  - No studies showed >20% loss to follow-up                                                                            
                                                                                                                        
