  **CONSERVATIVE SCREENING APPROACH:** Applied conservative inclusion principle - when uncertain about eligibility,     
  studies were included for full-text review rather than excluded at title/abstract stage.                              
                                                                                                                        
  **LIMITATIONS OF TITLE/ABSTRACT SCREENING:**                                                                          
  - Some studies may require full-text review to confirm exact DS case numbers                                          
  - Follow-up rates not always clearly stated in abstracts                                                              
  - Some studies focus on related conditions (other aneuploidies) but may still be relevant                             
                                                                                                                        
  **RECOMMENDATIONS FOR NEXT STEPS:**                                                                                   
