│ than the 67% observed with free beta-hCG and PAPP-A. However, we have demonstrated for total hCG a significant       │
│ temporal change in median MoM with gestational age. Before 70 days the median MoM was less than 0.5, between 70 and  │
│ 83 days this increased to 1.13, and between 84 and 97 days this increased to 1.52. This median shift has significant │
