1. Evaluated first trimester serum markers (PAPP-A, free beta-hCG, HhCG, ADAM 12, PGH, GHBP, FA-2, proMBP, CA-125, AFP, 
hCG)
2. Had adequate Down's syndrome case numbers (≥5 cases)
3. Used appropriate study designs (case-control, consecutive series, or prospective screening)
4. Compared index tests to reference standards (chromosomal verification)

**Excluded Studies (79):**
