- Study 577: Largest case-control study with 210 DS cases evaluating free beta-hCG and PAPP-A
- Study 528: ADAM 12 marker evaluation with 218 DS cases
- Study 514: Large prospective study with 11,107 women and 52 DS cases detected
- Study 538: Integrated screening study using published data with 77 DS cases

**Conservative Approach:**
Studies with borderline characteristics (e.g., 11-15 weeks gestation, combined ultrasound and serum) were included when 
serum marker data could be extracted, following the conservative screening principle of including uncertain studies for 
full-text review.
