          {"study_index": 601, "title": "Maternal serum alpha‐fetoprotein and ethnic origin", "abstract": "G. BARKAI,   
  B. GOLDMAN, L. RIES, R. CHAKI and HS CUCKLE, LETTER TO THE EDITOR. ETHNIC ORIGIN AND MATERNAL SERUM MARKERS OF DOWN   
  SYNDROME IN ISRAEL, Prenatal Diagnosis, 16, 9,(870-872),(1999).HC WATT, NJ WALD, D. SMITH, A. KENNARD and J. DENSEM,  
