9. **Study 609** - Ultrasound marker (nuchal translucency), not serum test
10. **Study 612** - Second trimester quadruple test, not first trimester
11. **Study 614** - Cochrane Review protocol, not primary research
12. **Study 616** - Second trimester, focuses on adverse pregnancy outcomes not DS detection
13. **Study 617** - Second trimester markers, no Down's syndrome cases, no reference standard

